l Service Business\n\nGroup, transitioning to a seven-business\n\ngroup structure\n\n• Announced the MUFG Carbon Neutrality\n\nDeclaration\n\n2022 • Sold MUFG Union Bank\n\n• Decided investment of approximately ·200 billion in digital finance field in Asia\n\n2023\n\n• Alliance 2.0-Enhancement of\n\nstratedic alliance with\n\nMorgan Stanley D\n\n• MUFG × Morgan Stanley\n\nAlliance 2.0\n\n• Decided strategic investment in Global\n\nAM/IS area (AlbaCore, Link)\n\n2024\n\n• Converted Mitsubishi UFJ Asset Management into a wholly owned subsidiary\n\n• Converted WealthNavi into a wholly\n\nowned subsidiary\n\n2025\n\n• Changed the name of au Kabucom Securities to Mitsubishi eSmart Securities and converted it into a wholly\n\nowned subsidiary\n\n2025\n\n20th\n\nanniversary of establish-\n\nment\n\nCommitted to empowering\n\na brighter future.", "width": 1654, "height": 2339, "blocks": [{"kind": "text", "text": "MUFG Report 2025", "bbox": {"x": 37.4, "y": 1978.6, "width": 27.199999999999996, "height": 197.19999999999982}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Management Message", "bbox": {"x": 44.2, "y": 1448.3, "width": 20.39999999999999, "height": 197.20000000000005}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MUFG's Corporate Value", "bbox": {"x": 44.2, "y": 1203.5, "width": 20.39999999999999, "height": 207.4000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Strategies to Improve Corporate Value", "bbox": {"x": 44.2, "y": 836.3, "width": 20.39999999999999, "height": 326.39999999999986}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Foundation Supporting the Corporate Value", "bbox": {"x": 44.2, "y": 428.4, "width": 20.39999999999999, "height": 377.4}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Data Section", "bbox": {"x": 44.2, "y": 278.8, "width": 20.39999999999999, "height": 115.59999999999997}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "25", "bbox": {"x": 37.4, "y": 156.4, "width": 27.199999999999996, "height": 37.400000000000006}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MUFG's Corporate Value", "bbox": {"x": 149.4, "y": 1893.6, "width": 27.19999999999999, "height"